<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 22.00 pct, 3-mo 21.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 22.00 pct, 3-mo 21.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) firmed slightly for the one-month maturity and remained steady for the three-month maturity, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Friday..</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 22.00 percent, up from 21.99 percent, while the three-month rate was unchanged at 21.75 percent, the NBH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
